<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Romanian president to visit Prague in March.</title>
<headline>Romanian president to visit Prague in March.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romanian President Emil Constantinescu will make an official visit to the Czech Republic next month at the invitation of Czech President Vaclav Havel, a statement from Havel's office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Details of Constantinescu's visit, on March 10 and 11, would be announced later, the statement said.</p>
